      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The pressure to \"perform\" life when your inner world feels vacant is exhausting and completely overwhelming. It makes perfect sense that you feel like stopping the performance is the only authentic choice. However, even when it feels empty, there is still a capacity to feel, and professional support can help you gently access that again. Please know that you don't have to decide on the future right now; right now, just focusing on surviving the next hour is enough.",
